# Marimo
marimo/_static/
marimo/_lsp/
__marimo__/
firebase_key.json
# Temp stores written by the test suites. They point their storage at these via
# env vars so the real ones are never touched — but the files are still left on
# disk afterwards, and a committed one would seed a fresh checkout with a
# test fixture. The .test_/.smoke_ prefixes are the convention the suites use.
.test_announcements.json
.test_*.json
.smoke_*.json

# Scratch output from tools/verify_admin_styles.py. It extracts the dashboard's
# inline <script> to a file so `node --check` can parse it, which makes it a
# derived copy of code that already lives in dashboard.js — committing it would
# create a second, stale version of the same script.
_inline_dashboard.js

# Scratch children/backups written by tools/verify_settings_persist.py. It hides
# the local JSON stores to simulate a fresh container, so these only exist while
# that script is mid-run — and a committed one would restore itself over real
# state on the next run.
*.persistprobe
tools/_persist_child.py




